{
  "$comment": "Route classification and route-monitor vectors shared by Web (Vitest), Android (JVM) and iOS (swift test). docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 6, docs/TRANSFER_PROTOCOL.md section 6. Stats are reduced to the fields the classifier reads; rtt is seconds as in WebRTC stats. Monitor rules: a stall is stallMs without verified progress while connected (measured from the last progress, start or rebase); losses are counted per step within lossWindowMs; a migration starts a cooldown (now - lastMigration >= cooldownMs to migrate again), advances the step and clears the losses; the last step never migrates. 'rebase': the caller rebases on the new channel before the sample.",
